      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "2015 BMJ Publishing Group Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "A smile expresses feelings of joy, affection and self-confidence in an individual. Melanin hyperpigmentation of the gingiva jeopardises the aesthetics of an individual significantly. In the present case, gingival depigmentation was performed with a surgical scalpel along with local applications of ascorbic acid, yielding satisfactory aesthetic results with low subjective pain levels, and no recurrence has been observed after 9\u2005months of follow-up."
      },
